{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons","id":15819,"title":"Embeds and Non-Demons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-21T19:58:03-08:00","id":15819,"title":"Embeds and Non-Demons","content":"If Embeds are representative of secret physical laws written into the very fabric of the universe, then isn't it feasible that non-demons could learn about them and how to use them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T20:30:47-08:00","id":15832,"title":"","content":"If mechanical tools are representative of physical laws written into the very fabric of the universe, then isn't it feasible that the animal kingdom could learn about them and how to use them?<br /> <br /> Well, they do. Monkeys narrow down sticks to dig ants out of anthills. Orangutans, presented with boats, learn how to paddle them around. Elephants use backscratchers. A man built a little go-kart for his pet bird. She steers it around his backyard with her beak.<br /> <br /> But I wouldn't expect a silverback to design a system of calculus or a chimpanzee to build a Kindle.<br /> <br /> It may be that the mechanical mind of demons has qualities that grants them greater facility with these secret laws, such that they can be called upon reliably and with relatively little outward manipulation. We are the animal kingdom, and our psychology does not work on this occult level of fine dexterity and design. Still, occult laws are occult laws, and nature finds a way. One could argue that psychic powers, sorcerous rituals or simple superstitions efficacious in the World of Darkness are signs of mortals manipulating the same occult physics that enable a demon's Embeds, with a grosser, less facile aspect, working with what we can find in our environment, testing it, and exploring the edges of what causes and effect we can understand intuitively.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T20:38:05-08:00","id":15840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons#post15819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Embeds are representative of secret physical laws written into the very fabric of the universe, then isn't it feasible that non-demons could learn about them and how to use them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Reminds me of the &quot;Hacking Reality&quot; seed thing from GMC, where someone got access to the GM. Could make for a good plot device, but I wouldn't think everyday humans would be able to have that level of understanding. Demons do have some level of intimate knowledge of the God Machine's workings, though not entirely its plans. This gives them a huge leg up in such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T20:54:13-08:00","id":15855,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons?p=15832#post15832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It may be that the mechanical mind of demons has qualities that grants them greater facility with these secret laws, such that they can be called upon reliably and with relatively little outward manipulation. We are the animal kingdom, and our psychology does not work on this occult level of fine dexterity and design. Still, occult laws are occult laws, and nature finds a way. One could argue that psychic powers, sorcerous rituals or simple superstitions efficacious in the World of Darkness are signs of mortals manipulating the same occult physics that enable a demon's Embeds, with a grosser, less facile aspect, working with what we can find in our environment, testing it, and exploring the edges of what causes and effect we can understand intuitively.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hell, Pyretic involvement notwithstanding, that's basically the principle behind the creation rituals of Prometheans \u2014 exploiting a glitch in reality to bring the stuff that souls are made of into an assemblage of corpse-bits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T13:54:20-08:00","id":16269,"title":"","content":"The now apparently nixed Demon babies box mentioned that half-demons, this is, the offspring of Unchained and humans, can learn Embeds and Exploits. I hope the player guide gives us that template!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T16:55:08-08:00","id":16344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons?p=16269#post16269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The now apparently nixed Demon babies box mentioned that half-demons, this is, the offspring of Unchained and humans, can learn Embeds and Exploits. I hope the player guide gives us that template!</div> </div> </div> </div>It got nixed? I really liked that part. I think I'll keep it anyway. I had someone ask me about playing one for a game I'm planning.<br /> <br /> Any particular reason why they got rid of it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1279-badger-king","name":"Badger King","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1279_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T17:06:17-08:00","id":16345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Badger King</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons?p=16344#post16344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It got nixed? I really liked that part. I think I'll keep it anyway. I had someone ask me about playing one for a game I'm planning.<br /> <br /> Any particular reason why they got rid of it?</div> </div> </div> </div>The part where every demon/demon baby gets murdered was a bit much, upon reflection.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T18:06:48-08:00","id":16377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kirby Jerusalem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons?p=16345#post16345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The part where every demon/demon baby gets murdered was a bit much, upon reflection.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh I was talking about the half-demon children.<br /> <br /> The demon/demon ones seemed to be in keeping with The One from The Matrix. Something too powerful for the G-M to let exist. I'm sure there could be something interesting coming from it though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1279-badger-king","name":"Badger King","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1279_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T20:12:39-08:00","id":16438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons#post15819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Embeds are representative of secret physical laws written into the very fabric of the universe, then isn't it feasible that non-demons could learn about them and how to use them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly. Mostly, no. The God Machine built secret loopholes into the nature of reality specifically for its servants to use, then built servants specifically to use those loopholes. Demons can kinda sorta use them (though not really as intended) because they're fallen angels. But if you're not related to angels in some way (like a half-demon), there's no particular reason for you to be able to use those loopholes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T02:21:17-08:00","id":16531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kirby Jerusalem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons?p=16345#post16345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The part where every demon/demon baby gets murdered was a bit much, upon reflection.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it was an interesting hook to some extent, but the absoluteness of it was a little offputting, especially since the God Machine isn't normally omniscient. Without a little more detail it sounds more like a &quot;Demons don't get to knock boots with each other&quot; statement rather than a useful piece of info.<br /> <br /> That said, I could totally see a Saboteur attempting to fake being human long enough to impregnate an Integrator and then use her upcoming birth as a distraction to destroy as many pieces of infrastructure as possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T03:08:06-08:00","id":16547,"title":"","content":"In any case, I'm certainly interested in an official answer to the OP's question here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T06:10:03-08:00","id":16593,"title":"","content":"Demons which weren't created by the God Machine would feasibly have incredible amounts of Primum, given there's no inherent connection with the Machine to begin with. That's my take on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T09:00:36-08:00","id":17746,"title":"","content":"Just to clarify, just the last paragraph of the &quot;Little Monsters&quot; sidebar got axed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T09:24:04-08:00","id":17752,"title":"","content":"...and we have a really cool alternative...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T09:57:30-08:00","id":18478,"title":"","content":"Can't wait to see the alternative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T20:30:07-08:00","id":19521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Grim Lich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15819-embeds-and-non-demons?p=18478#post18478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can't wait to see the alternative.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's the $115k stretch goal for the Kickstarter, a short book called <i>Heirs to Hell.</i> Here's the pitch that I sent to Rich:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Family is Hell</b> <br /> <br /> Demons have defected to the human race. For some of them, that means living the dream. Nice house. Picket fence. And starting a family, double life be damned.<br /> <br /> Unlike some monsters in the World of Darkness, demons pass on their nature to their children. Many are at least born stigmatic. Others manifest the gifts of demons or angels. Growing up the child of a demon is to be one step apart from your peers, and outsider who sees the connections between cause and effect, between secrets and cliques. These unearthly children are often drawn to investigate the mysteries everyone else in the neighborhood wants to ignore.<br /> <br /> <b>Children of Darkness</b><br /> <br /> Heirs to Hell will cover what it's like to grow up as the heir to a demon, both with and without the guidance of an Unchained parent, and the unique kinds of trouble the heritage of the Machine gets you into. Heirs aren't automatically hunted by the God-Machine, but they're haunted by it, always tied to the awareness of something greater than themselves, something not friendly. We'll provide character creation and a few unique abilities for heirs, both at the adolescent and adult levels, as well as plot hooks galore for using them as a protagonist class by themselves or parts of a Demon: The Descent group. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T22:47:02-08:00","id":19567,"title":"","content":"And now suddenly I need to see this in print.<br /> <br /> WHY CAN'T I HAVE TEN THOUSAND DOLLARS JUST LYING AROUND","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}